# Rendered by paisans. Do not edit: `paisans apply` overwrites this file.
#
# Routing for talk, imported by the gateway's block for
# talk.example.org.
#
# The upstream port is the one the app's compose.yaml publishes on the mesh
# address of each site it runs on, and the one FrankenPHP is told to listen on
# there (SERVER_NAME), so this routes plain HTTP: TLS ends at the gateway.
#
# Media is not routed here. Upstream advises serving it from a hostname of
# its own, so media URLs survive a change of storage provider and the S3
# endpoint is not exposed to readers, and that is what
# caddy.snippet.media.tmpl does: talk-media.example.org is a separate site
# block with its own snippet.
reverse_proxy 10.44.0.1:8080 10.44.0.2:8080 {
	# Failover across apps sites; see upstream_failover in the Caddyfile.
	import upstream_failover
	header_up X-Forwarded-Proto https
	# A gated host block passes a block here for ActivityPub reads, to filter
	# what comes back; every other import passes none.
	{block}
}
